<Base
  title="Photography — Chance B. Ronemus"
  description="Landscape and wildlife photography by Chance B. Ronemus, mainly from field areas in the Andes of Argentina and Chile."
>
  <h1>Photography</h1>

  <p>I take pictures of the places in which I work and play. Here are some photos of landscapes, mainly in my study areas of the Andes (plus a few bird photos).</p>

  <p>Please contact me if you're interested in a print. I'm also happy to share full-size digital versions for use in teaching or research.</p>

